<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2c40fcd0-ef98-4bb0-bfb3-b44d549cbbde> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ROBOT `reason` — rejected: it writes a reduced, serialized ontology rather than an entailment closure, bundles its own OWL API and reasoner versions, and gives no control over log appenders, so neither the pins nor the fail-on-warning rule could be enforced." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/2c40fcd0-ef98-4bb0-bfb3-b44d549cbbde> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
