<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/76992b94-56d2-4cbc-87eb-5e3e15167f31> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Walk a fixed side of each join (S(X) for CR2's other conjunct as SPEC's table first said; S(Y) for CR4 as Alternative 3e4c37f3 argued) - rejected: neither side is always cheaper. A general conjunct heads thousands of conjunctions and a busy role heads thousands of existentials, while a context holds tens of subsumers, and the reverse also occurs; the minimum dominates both." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
