<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/9e1c75ea-d4b1-4414-abd4-b1add1a6671a> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "This was the route SPEC §5.3's first accepted text took: apply BBL05 Lemma 3 to T_H with I_a ≡ {a}. KKS12 (KR 2012) shows the procedure is incomplete with nominals (Example 5). The accepted route uses Lemma 3 only for soundness and proves completeness through a nominal-free canonical model (L5, L8)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
