<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Alternative/ff8fec6d-879a-4948-81cd-cf959ae71946> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-28T22:56:56.043846Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
