<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/054d7f53-011c-45cb-aa11-051c9e2a4c89> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "§5.3 re-routed around BBL05's refuted nominal completeness (KKS12); re-accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/054d7f53-011c-45cb-aa11-051c9e2a4c89> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/054d7f53-011c-45cb-aa11-051c9e2a4c89> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "SPEC §5.3 had applied BBL05 Lemma 3 to a CBox with nominals (I_a ≡ {a}). KKS12 (Kazakov, Krötzsch, Simančík, KR 2012) shows that completeness claim is false for nominals: \"Although rule (42) is sound, this procedure is not complete for nominals\". Their Example 5 entails A ⊑ B, which the rules miss.\n\n**The theorem is unchanged.** Only the route changed (L1, L5, L8):\n- The calculus now runs on the nominal-free T_H′.\n- L5 shows I_a ∈ S(C) only if C = I_a.\n- L8's canonical model of T_H′ has each I_a as a singleton, so it is a model of T_H.\n\n**Review.** Codex reviewed it over two passes and signed off, with no counterexample and two minor findings fixed. The project owner re-accepted it on 2026-09-30. No code changed; abox-fuzz stays clean." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/054d7f53-011c-45cb-aa11-051c9e2a4c89> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/054d7f53-011c-45cb-aa11-051c9e2a4c89> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/da029cbf-5617-4524-877b-12d3937f6e5d> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/054d7f53-011c-45cb-aa11-051c9e2a4c89> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-30T21:08:36.822911Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/054d7f53-011c-45cb-aa11-051c9e2a4c89> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "§5.3 re-routed around BBL05's refuted nominal completeness (KKS12); re-accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
