<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/0a88410d-0abc-42cc-a2e8-f7c9cb597a5c> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Peak resident memory, default macOS allocator [MallocLargeCache=0]: GO 3,853 -> 2,608 MB [2,617 -> 1,671], EL-GALEN 2,441 -> 2,059 [1,650 -> 1,102], OBI 719 -> 580 [540 -> 288]; GO's parse+decode 1.56 -> 1.32 s. With the cache off, GO's peak is now the parse arena plus reasoning, not the front end's intermediates" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
