<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/27f167aa-cf93-42a3-8b5d-c7fd68ba1fc0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "el++ feasibility checkpoint: OBI 1.6 s, GO ~31 s projected, EL-GALEN ~11.5 h projected" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/27f167aa-cf93-42a3-8b5d-c7fd68ba1fc0> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/27f167aa-cf93-42a3-8b5d-c7fd68ba1fc0> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Slice 4's feasibility checkpoint, measured on the single-threaded prototype engine (src/kscsat.slop: phase G, then one run per class over G) on this machine (arm64), with HOWL's el++ gate and normaliser on the repo's corpus:\n- **OBI (el++ projection, 12,075 accepted axioms, 296 omitted):** all 5,241 classes in 1.60 s, mean 178 facts per class run (max 1,193), 424 MB peak. The only unsat class is owl:Nothing, which K5 excludes, so OBI stays coherent.\n- **GO (92,226 accepted, 1 omitted):** 1-in-20 sample, 2,600 classes in 1.56 s, 0.6 ms/class, mean 57 facts; about 31 s projected for 51,988 classes on one thread.\n- **EL-GALEN (46,515 accepted):** 11 sampled classes in 19.6 s, 1.8 s/class, about 11.5 h projected, 7.9 GB peak. Bimodal: a class needs under 400 facts, or about 3.8M (594k inst, 3.2M triple) when its existential cone reaches the anatomy part, and every such class re-derives the same cone because K2 shares only G.\n\nThe plan's gate was OBI (stop and re-plan if infeasible); it passes, so slice 5 proceeds. GO and EL-GALEN are measured, not gated. The EL-GALEN cost is SPEC §5.4's \"Cost, stated plainly\" made concrete: sharing witness contexts across classes where no nominal or ⊥ reaches them ([Krö10] Theorem 3's construction) would remove it, and needs its own proof before use." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/27f167aa-cf93-42a3-8b5d-c7fd68ba1fc0> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/27f167aa-cf93-42a3-8b5d-c7fd68ba1fc0> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-10-01T07:58:00.206802Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
