<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/2e49fa80-754d-4f4a-9632-e7686544ef91> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/2e49fa80-754d-4f4a-9632-e7686544ef91> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Parallel el++ commit: EL-GALEN W=4 1.49 → 1.31 s, W=8 1.19 → 0.90 s; reports unchanged" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/2e49fa80-754d-4f4a-9632-e7686544ef91> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/2e49fa80-754d-4f4a-9632-e7686544ef91> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "Measured 2026-10-04 with `howl validate --profile el++`: reasoning time, median of 3, both builds in the same session.\n\n| | W=1 | W=4 | W=8 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| EL-GALEN | 3.41 → 3.48 s | 1.49 → 1.31 s (−12%) | 1.19 → 0.90 s (−24%) |\n| GO | 0.84 → 0.85 s | 0.44 → 0.40 s (−9%) | 0.38 → 0.31 s (−17%) |\n\n**Other measurements:**\n- **Variance:** an earlier interleaved session gave −17% and −11% at W=4.\n- **One worker is ~2% slower:** a shard lookup on every read, and filing split into two halves.\n- **Peak memory** (high-water) at W=4 falls 818 → 644 MB on EL-GALEN and 630 → 565 MB on GO.\n- **Bench** (`make bench-el++`, W=4): GO 1.10× → 0.95× ELK, EL-GALEN 6.01× → 5.25×. Every report hash is unchanged.\n\n**Checks:**\n- All 21 gates pass; every golden is byte-identical, including el++'s rounds lines.\n- determinism: 5,856 el++ comparisons, identical. verify 87/0/0. ASan and TSan report nothing.\n- New test-ksc-commit-identical: on every fixture, a 4-shard parallel run equals the 1-shard serial run in rounds, facts, unsat and capped, and fact for fact both ways, in G's shape (stop at ⊥) and W's.\n\n**Mutants, each caught:**\n- Δₙ₊₁ built out of order: caught by test-ksc-workers-agree and test-ksc-commit-identical. The CLI determinism gate does not catch it, because reports are sorted.\n- One `:arena` dropped: TSan reports the race in il-push from commit-subjects.\n- Stop-at-bottom fallback skipped: caught on fixture 7 by both tests.\n\n**Codex review:** no defects." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/2e49fa80-754d-4f4a-9632-e7686544ef91> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/2e49fa80-754d-4f4a-9632-e7686544ef91> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-10-04T05:05:42.519914Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
