<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/3b126a2d-ba28-4ef6-af7a-0d7298ccdad0> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Per-class re-derivation is the main cost risk: each q re-derives the witnesses reachable from it, so work is roughly classes × existential cone. Slice 4 has a feasibility checkpoint on OBI and a 2k-class GO slice; if OBI is infeasible, stop and re-plan toward a filler-sharing optimisation under its own proof (TR 3005 Theorem 3's Q(c) construction)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
