<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/44c17d7d-7b3d-4a19-a434-32b1a000af1d> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "slop's lazy collections take GO to 5.05x and EL-GALEN to 6.08x ELK, peaks down 20-42%" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/44c17d7d-7b3d-4a19-a434-32b1a000af1d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/44c17d7d-7b3d-4a19-a434-32b1a000af1d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "HOWL was regenerated from slop main 0dfe4c3, which adds three things:\n- #217: list-new, map-new and set-new allocate on first use;\n- #213: a with-arena frees on every return;\n- #216: map-get values and destructured map keys are typed.\n\nEvery report is unchanged: goldens, the corpus report hashes, and determinism across 2,016 comparisons. Every gate passes.\n\n**Bench** (quiet machine, load 2.7–3.9):\n\n| Entry | Classify | Oracle | Ratio | Peak |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| GO | 2,122 ms (runs 2,109–2,132) | ELK 420 ms | **5.05×**, FAIL by a hair | 13.5 → 7.8 GB |\n| EL-GALEN | 1,655 ms | ELK 272 ms | **6.08×** | 6.6 → 5.3 GB |\n| OBI | 179 ms | HermiT 501 ms | 0.36× | 1.6 → 1.1 GB |\n\nAn earlier 4.88× GO figure, from the unmerged branch, rode a slower ELK run. This one is the honest figure.\n\n**The S6 series:**\n\n| | GO | EL-GALEN |\n|---|---|---|\n| S6a | 19.2× | 30.1× |\n| step A | 16.6× | 22.4× |\n| #205 | 9.5× | 12.3× |\n| step B | 7.2× | ~13× |\n| C0 | 6.3× | 11.4× |\n| C1 | 5.9× | 7.7× |\n| C2 | 5.6× | 6.4× |\n| + #213/#216/#217 | **5.05×** | **6.08×** |\n\n**What remains.**\n- **GO:** most of its classify window is the RDF-to-axiom front end. The ELK side's equivalent sits inside its untimed OWL API parse, so the boundary is the open question: measure axioms-to-taxonomy on both sides, with decode reported alongside.\n- **EL-GALEN:** the gap is in reasoning. HOWL materializes super-role edges and builds every edge, where ELK is goal-directed; the told role closure (Alternative 411048ad) is the next lever there." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/44c17d7d-7b3d-4a19-a434-32b1a000af1d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/44c17d7d-7b3d-4a19-a434-32b1a000af1d> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-29T06:18:09.574569Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
