<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/4be3b5f6-c254-45ec-8f0b-59329da0b604> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/4be3b5f6-c254-45ec-8f0b-59329da0b604> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The rounds figure drops wherever a role hierarchy is in play, so a deliberate golden and corpus-pin update came with it: two probe goldens, EL-GALEN's report hash and its howl-report pin in corpus-differential.txt. Capped runs over hierarchies can now derive more within the same budget" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
