<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/4be3b5f6-c254-45ec-8f0b-59329da0b604> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/4be3b5f6-c254-45ec-8f0b-59329da0b604> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-29T08:16:24.919808Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/4be3b5f6-c254-45ec-8f0b-59329da0b604> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "The rounds figure drops wherever a role hierarchy is in play, so a deliberate golden and corpus-pin update came with it: two probe goldens, EL-GALEN's report hash and its howl-report pin in corpus-differential.txt. Capped runs over hierarchies can now derive more within the same budget" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5068df77-684f-4133-822f-1de8d81a5788> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5068df77-684f-4133-822f-1de8d81a5788> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "slop's compact collections take GO to 1.8 GB (0.9 GB with the arena fix)" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5068df77-684f-4133-822f-1de8d81a5788> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5068df77-684f-4133-822f-1de8d81a5788> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "HOWL was regenerated from slop main a517784. slop #234 stores a Map's and Set's keys and values inline in a dense table: there is no per-entry key or value allocation, and the first table has 4 entries. Every report is unchanged, including goldens, the `-I` golden, corpus hashes, determinism and diff-corpus.\n\nPeak memory, default allocator [MallocLargeCache=0]:\n\n| | before | after |\n|---|---|---|\n| GO | 2,608 MB [1,671] | 1,814 MB [913] |\n| EL-GALEN | 2,059 MB [1,102] | 1,537 MB [635] |\n| OBI | 580 MB [288] | 407 MB [236] |\n\nWith the cache off, which is what slop's pending arena fix gives, GO matches ELK's smallest workable 0.9 GB.\n\n**Bench:** M1 (c) met, GO 0.69× and EL-GALEN 2.69× ELK. ELK ran slower than in earlier benches; against those medians HOWL is about 0.9× and 3.1×.\n\n**Verify:** slop #228 now proves `@loop-invariant`s rather than trusting them. saturate's budget invariant comes back unknown: the check cannot follow the loop's c-inline, its breaks, or advance-round's map-carrying arguments. advance-round gained the proved one-round `@post` the invariant rests on. Result: 35 verified, 0 failed, 1 unknown." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5068df77-684f-4133-822f-1de8d81a5788> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5068df77-684f-4133-822f-1de8d81a5788> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-30T02:14:01.70735Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5068df77-684f-4133-822f-1de8d81a5788> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "slop's compact collections take GO to 1.8 GB (0.9 GB with the arena fix)" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
