<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5ee5f26a-e170-4ef1-b813-7736d99bcc9f> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Axioms-in-hand boundary: GO 1.43x, EL-GALEN 5.32x ELK" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5ee5f26a-e170-4ef1-b813-7736d99bcc9f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5ee5f26a-e170-4ef1-b813-7736d99bcc9f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "With decode moved out of HOWL's window (D1 alone, before the role closure), the §12 bench gave GO 1.43x (713 vs 499 ms) and EL-GALEN 5.32x (1591 vs 299 ms). With decode inside the window they had been 5.05x and 6.08x. GO's gap had been almost entirely the RDF-to-axiom decode (1488 ms, now reported as howl_decode_ms). EL-GALEN's remaining gap was reasoning (1373 ms), which D2 addressed. Median of 5 at W = 4, load 2.2 -> 3.8." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/5ee5f26a-e170-4ef1-b813-7736d99bcc9f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
