<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/614e5aad-7636-4936-8401-3adea6fcfe4f> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "M1 (c) is NOT MET at S6a (bench/results.txt, Apple M3 Ultra, W = 4): GO 10,636 ms against ELK 554 ms (19.20x), EL-GALEN 9,566 ms against ELK 318 ms (30.08x). HermiT-routed, reported only: OBI 742 against 566 ms (1.31x), RO 56 against 170 ms (0.33x). HOWL's run-to-run spread is about ±10%, and the verdict holds across it. On EL-GALEN, about 59% of reasoning samples are Node/RoleId IRI hashing and equality, which trips Alternative 8e9221e2's 30% interning trigger. On GO the single-threaded front end (about 7 s) dominates. The work to close the gap is S6b." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
