<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/61e73eb7-6134-4b72-9062-e24e68c376ff> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Rule (13) is represented by the dispatcher's sup*/sub* reads, not by a per-instance rule function, so its coverage is held by the reference differential (which keeps rule (13)), not by a contract. SPEC §7 says so." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
