<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/6220815f-d6d7-4467-80c5-53cee445898d> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Step A peaks (bench, W = 4): GO 913 -> 792 MB (0.61-0.82 GB across runs, 0.59 GB at W = 1), EL-GALEN 624 -> 628 (its peak is the report), OBI 236 -> 133, RO 23 -> 13; every report hash unchanged, all 16 gates pass. Bench: M1 (c) met, GO 0.89x and EL-GALEN 3.18x ELK (ELK at 0.49 s / 0.28 s this run, HOWL's own times unchanged). GO's decode_ms is unchanged within noise and prepare_ms falls ~25 ms." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
