<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/79fd3f3f-2fb1-4b26-bef7-44a641e56d52> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Peak memory (default macOS allocator) drops only 80-130 MB (EL-GALEN 2,690 -> 2,561, GO 4,826 -> 4,743) with reasoning time unchanged; with macOS's large-block cache off, reasoning no longer rises above the front end's peak at all, so the front end sets the peak (GO 3,412 MB, EL-GALEN 1,765 MB)" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
