<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/81dc85a9-bc11-4320-a371-f72a3092f859> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/81dc85a9-bc11-4320-a371-f72a3092f859> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-08-17T22:28:51.939816Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
