<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/9151f3b8-e711-4fd7-8979-de8913646a92> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/9151f3b8-e711-4fd7-8979-de8913646a92> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bench (W = 4, load 2.2 -> 3.7): GO peak 792 -> 566 MB and steady (its peak now decode's), OBI 133 -> 103, EL-GALEN 628 -> 591 (its reasoning peak 506 -> ~314; its overall peak is the report); every report unchanged, all 16 gates pass, verify 38/0/1. Reasoning is also faster, from fewer fresh pages: GO classify 437 -> 377 ms (0.78x ELK), EL-GALEN 885 -> 823 ms (3.06x)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
