<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/925ded84-3212-41b0-8b6e-37ed8b72805e> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "slop's OS-mapped arena blocks take GO to 0.91 GB, level with ELK's minimum" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/925ded84-3212-41b0-8b6e-37ed8b72805e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/925ded84-3212-41b0-8b6e-37ed8b72805e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "HOWL was regenerated from slop main 18a5f44. slop #235 maps big arena blocks from the OS, so freeing an arena now returns its memory; macOS's malloc had kept freed large blocks resident. This resolves Lesson adeb3806. Every report is unchanged, all gates pass, and verify reports 35 verified / 0 failed / 1 unknown.\n\n**Peak memory** (default allocator; now equal to the earlier MallocLargeCache=0 figures):\n\n| | before | now | oracle's smallest workable heap |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| GO | 1,814 MB | 913 MB | ELK 0.9 GB |\n| EL-GALEN | 1,537 MB | 624 MB | ELK 0.43 GB |\n| OBI | 407 MB | 236 MB | HermiT 0.24 GB |\n| RO | 29 MB | 23 MB | HermiT 0.23 GB |\n\nSince M1, GO has gone from 7.9 GB to 0.91 GB.\n\n**Where each peak falls.** Each phase now has its own high-water mark, since the one before it is freed.\n- **GO** peaks in prepare: 913 MB, made up of the input dictionary (~400 MB, which survives the parse) plus the decoded axioms, gate and normalizer. Its parse reaches 851 MB, and freeing the parse arena drops that to 402 MB.\n- **EL-GALEN** peaks while writing the report (590 MB); its parse reaches 535 MB.\n- **OBI and RO** peak in the parse.\n\n**Parse costs on GO.** slop-rdf's parser alone takes ~430 ms and ~450 MB; HOWL's encoding adds ~300 ms and ~400 MB.\n\n**Bench** (clean run): M1 (c) met, GO 0.77×, EL-GALEN 2.60×. ELK ran slower than in earlier sessions; against those medians the figures are about 1.0× and 3.2×. Returning memory costs a little time: GO's classification went from 0.39 to 0.44 s." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/925ded84-3212-41b0-8b6e-37ed8b72805e> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
