<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/b3f171a8-af1d-4080-8c39-f5b087fa885b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-28T15:22:34.074325Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
