<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/d8137337-5110-4947-830a-77641ff1decf> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
