<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/d98a51ef-296a-4d41-a7b3-ee4592486c0b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-29T19:51:47.338293Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
