<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/de7205c5-3be1-4177-970d-dd31ade2a05a> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/de7205c5-3be1-4177-970d-dd31ade2a05a> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Wiring a rung in is a deliberate, verified edit: `profile-implemented`'s postcondition pins that only el is built. Mutations were seen red: an explicit sriq silently downgraded to el (verifier + test), sriq marked implemented (verifier + test), the default reverted to auto (verifier), the Rust enum reordered (layout guard), the report's profile line dropped (95 golden failures)." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
