<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/e9f949af-a048-41cd-8b57-1f0f0ecff8c4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/e9f949af-a048-41cd-8b57-1f0f0ecff8c4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Evidence beside the proof: seven ABox lemma fixtures (super-role range, complex range filler, domain on an asserted edge, mixed and n-ary chains over individuals, owl:Nothing(a), complex class assertion), all diff-clean against HermiT; make abox-fuzz: 400 of 400 generated v0 ontologies with ABoxes match HermiT (169 inconsistent). Mutations caught by both fixtures and fuzz: range seeds dropped; direct ranges only; asserted edges routed through ∃ (the fuzzer needed a bias toward two roles' disjoint ranges meeting at one individual before it caught that one). Right-associated chain decomposition was dropped as a mutation: it changes no answer, only the paper's literal restriction." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
