<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/f544fd5c-cdac-44a8-8aff-64dbd2042224> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "HOWL should delete merge-run and sort-range in favour of the sort builtin when slop-lang/slop#121 ships it, since the builtin is designed to carry the permutation and sortedness axioms that the WP checker cannot derive from this hand-written body." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
