<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ff916d0b-8669-49af-9b61-08da90e7a6bd> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#Consequence> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ff916d0b-8669-49af-9b61-08da90e7a6bd> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The figure compared against ELK is prepare_ms + reason_ms, decode excluded, because ELK indexes inside its window" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ff916d0b-8669-49af-9b61-08da90e7a6bd> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ff916d0b-8669-49af-9b61-08da90e7a6bd> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "The classification figure §12 M1 (c) compares against the oracle is `prepare_ms + reason_ms`, not `reason_ms` alone.\n- `reason_ms` counts saturation plus extraction.\n- `prepare_ms` counts gate, normalize, rename, initialize and the premise index.\n- Decode (triples to axioms) is `decode_ms`, outside the window as the OWL API's RDF mapping is outside ELK's, and reported beside it.\n\nELK 0.6.0 loads and indexes its axioms lazily, at the first query, so its indexing falls inside its classification window. `oracle bench` times the phases: on EL-GALEN at W = 4, create ~4 ms, consistent (load and index) ~70 ms, classify ~185 ms. Excluding HOWL's index or normalization would therefore compare unlike boundaries in HOWL's favour.\n\nThe comments that say so:\n- the CLI's `print-timings`;\n- the `Prepared` comment in src/howl.slop;\n- SPEC §9 and §12." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ff916d0b-8669-49af-9b61-08da90e7a6bd> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Consequence/ff916d0b-8669-49af-9b61-08da90e7a6bd> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasRationale> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/7c376207-11a4-4e53-9312-f7eff117cc2f> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
