<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/ac6e4c4e-89e3-4407-beb1-e188ec9ed332> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTimestamp> "2026-09-28T22:32:09.615813Z"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
