<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/ac6e4c4e-89e3-4407-beb1-e188ec9ed332> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#isSupersededBy> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/a3d77d04-cd1f-4b73-9797-08a2b68ce681> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
