<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Lesson/efa41206-ca53-4fa3-80f9-505ac464bddc> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#learnedFrom> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/ArchitecturalDecision/5cecf538-1be2-4f57-a979-888812c3b7d4> <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
