<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/d72d6cbb-1945-4854-a76c-90036612f97b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasAuthor> "claude-code" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/d72d6cbb-1945-4854-a76c-90036612f97b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasDescription> "This proposal compressed 793f66a9's text and lost rationale that still holds: the census evidence, why nominals would change the data model, and the two opposite silent failure modes. It is withdrawn before ratification and replaced by a fresh proposal from 793f66a9 that keeps that text word for word and adds only the negation paragraph." <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/d72d6cbb-1945-4854-a76c-90036612f97b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasLifecycleStatus> "accepted" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
