<https://moosedev.dev/kg/Rationale/d72d6cbb-1945-4854-a76c-90036612f97b> <https://trivyn.io/ontologies/software/architecture#hasTitle> "Rationale: retract HOWL v0 language: ranges by elimination, positive ¬ by rewriting, nominals out" <https://moosedev.dev/kg/project> .
